---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { contact } from "@/data/site";
---

<BaseLayout title="Booking Policies | Orchha Palace" description="General arrival, cancellation and payment guidance for Orchha Palace bookings." stickyBooking={false}>
  <article class="legal-page"><div class="legal-page__content shell"><p class="eyebrow">Stay guidance</p><h1>Booking policies</h1><p>Last reviewed: 3 September 2026</p><h2>Arrival and departure</h2><p>Published hotel guidance lists check-in from 2:00 PM and check-out by 10:00 AM. Early arrival and late departure are subject to availability and may carry an additional charge.</p><h2>Rates and inclusions</h2><p>Rates, taxes, meal inclusions and offer conditions for Standard and Deluxe rooms are displayed in the official booking engine. The Presidential Suite is reserved directly by call or WhatsApp and is not sold online. No price shown elsewhere on this custom website overrides a confirmed offer.</p><h2>Cancellation and refunds</h2><p>Cancellation, amendment, prepayment and refund conditions vary by rate and stay dates. Review the exact conditions before payment and retain the confirmation email.</p><h2>Children and extra beds</h2><p>Occupancy, child, rollaway-bed and meal charges vary by room and booking. Confirm the final guest count in the official booking journey or with reservations.</p><h2>Identification and payment</h2><p>Guests may be asked for valid identification at check-in. Card and online payment details are handled by the official booking and payment providers, not this custom website.</p><h2>Need help?</h2><p>Contact <a href={`mailto:${contact.reservationsEmail}`}>{contact.reservationsEmail}</a> or call <a href={contact.primaryPhoneHref}>{contact.primaryPhone}</a> before booking if a policy affects your travel plans.</p></div></article>
</BaseLayout>
